<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $60 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets $60 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers IBJ International and New Japan Securities Europe Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $60 MLN	 COUPON     5.58	MATURITY    03.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
